# Her Memories (WotG 41), which has no handler, with Large Memory Fragments 1 and 3 only (GMs): the quest's run as in
# the main flow; its finish gives Large Memory Fragment 2, and with three fragments checkMemoryFragments does nothing:
# Her Memories stays current.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Amaura/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/955 SouthernSanDoriaS/Raustigne/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/169
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-82.867,-6.949,91.148 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg HerMemories current
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment1
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment3
login
trigger Amaura                             # 955
finish                                     # Of Malign Maladies begun
charvar Quest[7][72]Prog 3                 # a GM
keyitem FeyStone                           # a GM
warp 5.479,-1.999,44.456 SouthernSanDoriaS
trigger Raustigne                          # 169
finish                                     # the quest completed, three fragments: Her Memories stays current
